# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Response headers for the CamKIT site.
#
# Read by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify. GitHub Pages IGNORES this file — if you
# ever move the site there, every protection below silently disappears. That is
# a reason to prefer Pages, or to reproduce these headers at whatever fronts it.
#
# The Content-Security-Policy is the machine-enforced version of the promise
# both pages make in their footers. `form-action 'none'` means the browser
# itself refuses to submit the clinical form anywhere, and `connect-src` /
# `img-src` cap where any script on the page can send data — including
# GoatCounter's, which is the one third-party script we load and therefore the
# only realistic route by which a compromise could reach a clinician's entries.
#
# ENFORCING since 2026-08-13. It shipped as Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only
# and was switched over only after a clean devtools console on the live site:
# both pages plus the 404, working the calculator and printing to PDF.
#
# If you ever add a script, a stylesheet, an inline style attribute or a call to
# a new host, rename this back to Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only, redeploy,
# repeat that check, and only then enforce again. Enforcing an unverified policy
# can silently break the gauge or the counter, which is worse than no policy at
# all — and unlike a visible error, nobody reports a gauge that quietly stopped
# moving. Rollback is renaming this header and redeploying; nothing else.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' https://gc.zgo.at; style-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' https://camkit.goatcounter.com; connect-src https://camkit.goatcounter.com; form-action 'none'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains

# Fonts and logos are content-addressed by name and change only when the design
# does, so they can be cached hard. HTML and CSS stay revalidated so a fix to
# the item wording or the triage bands reaches clinicians on the next load.
/assets/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/logos/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
